{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nPreview for the selected item.\n\n## Spec\n- Stash: `git stash show -p stash@{n}` (including untracked files when present) rendered with the existing `diff_view` (syntax highlighting, side-by-side)\n- Worktree: HEAD commit summary (hash, author, date, subject) and its changed files\n- Read-only; no apply / pop\n\nPart of #103.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:15:02Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":107,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Worktrees: diff preview pane"}
